      `
    },
    {
      id: "children",
      title: "Children's Privacy",
      icon: "fa-child",
      content: `
        <p>InstituteHub is not intended for children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If you are a parent or guardian and believe that your child has provided us with personal information, please contact us immediately.</p>
